<title>UK: Rolls-Royce wins order worth up to 70 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Rolls-Royce wins order worth up to 70 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rolls-Royce Aero Engine Services Ltd said on Tuesday it had won an order worth up to 70 million sg from the UK Ministry of Defence for the support of RB211-524B4 engines for the Royal Air Force fleet of Lockheed L1011 TriStars.</p>
</text>
